sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Gateway
    participant Auth
    participant API
    participant Mongo

    User->>Gateway: Request /api/devices
    Gateway->>Auth: Validate JWT
    Auth-->>Gateway: Valid
    Gateway->>API: Forward request
    API->>Mongo: Query data
    Mongo-->>API: Results
    API-->>Gateway: JSON response
    Gateway-->>User: 200 OK
